<div class="landing-39">
<h2 class="landing-25">Kielbox Cloud: share from a server you run</h2>
<p class="landing-26">An optional self-hosted companion. The desktop app uploads captures to it, you browse them from any browser, and you hand out links that open without an account.</p>
</div>
<ul class="landing-40">
<li class="landing-41"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#5bd27e" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="landing-42"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Links expire after 1, 7 or 30 days, or never, and can be revoked at any time.</span></li>
<li class="landing-41"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#5bd27e" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="landing-42"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>You choose per link whether recipients can download the file.</span></li>
<li class="landing-41"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#5bd27e" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="landing-42"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>The page a recipient sees is plain HTML and CSS, with no JavaScript, trackers or third-party embeds.</span></li>
</ul>
